WARNING:
- the migration `20260911T0924_add_sales_and_sale_item` failed because the original store.currency DEFAULT value was 'USD'
    so when changed to DZ, prisma filed the update 
    the solution was to change the default value manually by running 
    ```sql
        ALTER TABLE "public"."store"
        ALTER COLUMN "currency" SET DEFAULT 'DZ';
    ```
    directly into the database

    the failure reason is unknown
    all the stages
        - contract emit
        - migration plan
    succeded
    the only failure was in 
        - db migrate
    appearanlty the part that is responsible for changing the default is the one who caused the failure
    yet the reason remains unknown
        - db verify - didn't report anything
        - the generated `migrations/app/20260911T0924_add_sales_and_sale_item/migration.ts` looks fine
        - the error was mismatch - althou it should be mismatch, that's why we are changing it
    
    !this documentation is for future updates in case the this error apeared again

